<h3><u>Tuje jhula jhulaun</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">tujhe jhula jhulaaun mai tujhe jhula jhulaaun<br />
mai khaab may asghar tujhe lori bhi sunaaun</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">laut aao safar se ke badi dayr hui hai<br />
betaab hoo kabse tuhjhe seene se lagaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">koi mujhe batlata nahi teri nishani<br />
barsaat may teero ki kahan dhoondne jaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">socha tha teri saalgira ghar may karungi<br />
taqdeer ye kehti hai tera soag manaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">baba se tere tera janaza na uthega<br />
rukja zara abbas ko darya se bulaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">ye khoon bhara kurta yeh matti may bhare baal<br />
seene may chupaun ke mai aankhon se lagaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">is tarha koi rooth-ke maa se nahi jaata<br />
tu khud bata-de mai tujhe kaise manaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">rehaan ke nowhe pe sada bano ki aayi<br />
mai aankhon se ashkon ke samandar ko bahaaun<br />
tujhe jhula jhulaaun....</p>
</p>